# Build output and tooling state. Without this the build context carries hundreds of megabytes
# and risks baking someone else's artefacts into the image.
**/bin/
**/obj/
.vs/
.git/
.github/
.claude/
.impeccable/

# Local secrets and developer files never belong in an image.
.env
**/*.user
**/appsettings.Development.json

docs/
deploy/
*.md
